 assets:broker:sub || 2026-02-01  58d  2 AAA       $20    $25   $40    $50   50.0%    $10   25.0%    $10   877.9% 
-------------------++---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                   ||                  4 AAA       $15          $60   $100  100.0%    $40   66.7%    $10  1928.8% 

# ** 46. RGain is shown with the cost commodity's display style, even when
# the cost basis it is derived from has more precision (here from an
# inferred per-unit cost).
<
commodity AAA ; lots:
commodity $1,000.00

2026-01-01 buy, with an inferred per-unit cost of $33.33333333
    assets:broker   3 AAA @@ $100
    assets:cash

2026-02-01 sell
    assets:broker  -1 AAA {} @ $50
    assets:cash
$ hledger -f- holdings -e 2026-03-01 --lots
Holdings on 2026-02-28

